        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: The distance between \\((a, b)\\) and \\((-a, b)\\) is the base of the equilateral triangle, which is \\(2a\\). This will be the side length of the equilateral triangle if we can find the height from the vertex \\((0,0)\\) to the midpoint of the base, which is \\((0, b)\\)."
      },
      {
