        "text": "Step 5: Substitute \\(b = \\sqrt{3}a\\) into the parabola equation \\(a^2 = 8b\\):\n\\[a^2 = 8(\\sqrt{3}a) \\implies a^2 = 8\\sqrt{3}a \\implies a(a - 8\\sqrt{3}) = 0.\\]\nSince \\(a \\neq 0\\), we get \\(a = 8\\sqrt{3}\\)."
